{%- comment -%} Black Friday sale tag; visible only during the sale window (html.bf-on). Accepts: modifier (optional) {%- endcomment -%}
<span class="bf-sticker bf-inline{% if modifier != blank %} bf-sticker--{{ modifier }}{% endif %}" role="img" aria-label="Black Friday, 25% off"><small>Black Friday</small><b>25% Off</b></span>
